9. STOPPING AND RESTARTING THE SYSTEM
================================================================================

Stop all services (preserving database and cache data):
$ docker compose down

Restart services:
$ docker compose up -d

Wipe and reinitialize everything from scratch (clean database and Redis volumes):
$ docker compose down -v
$ docker compose up -d --build
